    "title": "Holmdel holds off Colts Neck - Field hockey recap - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Cosentino ,\n28 minutes ago Avery Granata scored a pair of goals as Holmdel built a 4-1 lead at halftime and held on for a 4-3 win over Colts Neck in Holmdel. Teagan Flaherty had a goal and an assist and Mackenzie Davis also scored for Holmdel (2-1). Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
